WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.350
Every Israeli town makes health decisions.

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:07.750
The facts are open data,
scattered across many institutions.

3
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.848
Ask a chatbot,
and it may invent the number.

4
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:13.868
In public health, that is dangerous.

5
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:16.858
So we built a room.

6
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:22.650
CityPulse files the official data once:
every locality, every indicator.

7
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:25.360
1,494 localities.

8
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.269
41 indicators.

9
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.318
11 official sources.

10
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:33.450
Meet the orchestrator,
a watsonx Orchestrate agent.

11
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:38.136
A health officer asks it,
in Hebrew, where Sderot is weakest.

12
00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:43.387
It does not guess. Tool one,
from our OpenAPI file, finds the town.

13
00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.073
Tool two asks the room.

14
00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:51.937
The folder returns sealed.
Every figure is final.

15
00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:55.913
The model words the answer,
but cannot change a number.

16
00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:58.751
If it tries, the guard rejects it.

17
00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:02.805
Behind the room is the product.

18
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:06.794
Search any locality,
and one page tells the story.

19
00:01:08.850 --> 00:01:12.200
14 of 26 indicators need attention.

20
00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:13.387
What is going well.

21
00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:15.246
What changed.

22
00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:18.350
How it compares with similar towns.

23
00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:19.818
And what to do first.

24
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.099
Where the data is missing, it says so.

25
00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:29.270
Ask in plain language.

26
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:38.531
The AI decides which evidence to show,
and every figure comes from the data.

27
00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:44.462
Compare two towns side by side.

28
00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:50.608
Print a two-page report
for the local authority.

29
00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:53.950
And see how each indicator
moved over the years.

30
00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.837
And here is the Orchestrate agent itself.

31
00:01:57.100 --> 00:02:05.341
Same question, same figures:
51.9%, rank 167 of 187.

32
00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:12.788
Every number matches the API, because
the agent is told to copy, never to round.

33
00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:19.000
IBM Bob built the server layer: caching,

34
00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:23.860
security headers, validation,
share pages, CSV export.

35
00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.987
14 tasks. 49 Bobcoins.

36
00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:31.854
The data model and the screens:
built by our team.

37
00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:37.450
From open data, through one API,
to people and to AI agents.

38
00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:39.673
It runs on Cloudflare's edge,

39
00:02:39.673 --> 00:02:43.869
with a spend guard on every
AI call, and over 800 tests.

40
00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:47.729
The same pattern fits any open dataset.

41
00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:53.959
CityPulse. Trustworthy public-health data,
ready for people and for AI agents.
